    "description": "This dataset contains oceanographic data collected from NOAA Ship OKEANOS EXPLORER in the North Atlantic Ocean from 2021-05-14 to 2021-05-27. Data acquisition from shipboard sensors includes navigational data and meteorological data (altimetry, conductivity, depth, echo sounder, fluorescence, oxygen, pressure, relative humidity, salinity, sound velocity, temperature, turbidity, water temperature, wind, wind speed). Additional data includes Profile Data (ASVP, CTD, and XBT).",
